    "Classic and Modern skins"
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Is SeaMonkey still updated in 2026?",
      "a": "Yes. 2.53.24 was released on 2026-07-28 and 2.53.23 earlier in 2026."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does it run on 32-bit systems?",
      "a": "No. 2.53.21 was the last release with 32-bit Windows and Linux builds."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does it run on Windows 7?",
      "a": "The 2.53.24 release page says Windows 7 x64 and higher; Wikipedia said 2.53.23 was the last for Win 7/8, so there is a discrepancy."
    }
